{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "# Gemma 4 E4B-it — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where parameters and compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "**Dense** decoder, 42 layers: 35 sliding-window (512) + 7 full, pattern [5 sliding, 1 full] ×7.    \nRows — **grey**: sliding, own K/V · **cyan**: full, own K/V · **pale grey / pale cyan**: L24–41 compute **no K/V** and reuse the cache of L22 / L23.    \nEvery layer also gets its own 256-wide **per-layer embedding** slice (green). Images, video and audio enter through their own encoders (left)."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "tok2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**tokenizer** (vocab 262,144)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "ids3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 130,
   "y": -768,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
