  },
  {
   "id": "note-why",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1700,
   "y": 276,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 330,
   "text": "**Why 8B stored but \"E4B\".** 8.00B parameters are stored, but 3.49B of them are *lookup tables*: the per-layer-embedding table (2.82B) and the token embedding (671.1M). A token reads one row of each (10,752 + 2,560 numbers) — no multiply. Google's \"4.5B effective (8B with embeddings)\" = everything minus those two tables (4.51B).  \n\nPer text token the matmuls touch 4.64B: the 42 layers (minus the unused K/V of the shared ones), the PLE projection, and the tied lm head (the same 671.1M matrix, used as a matmul this time). The vision (169.3M) and audio (308.8M) encoders run once per image / clip."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tricks",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1700,
   "y": 636,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 300,
   "text": "**On-device tricks visible in the weights**  \n- **Per-layer embeddings**: a second, 10,752-wide embedding split into 42 slices of 256; it can sit in slow memory because a token only reads one row.\n- **KV sharing**: the last 18 layers reuse the K/V of L22 / L23 — no cache writes and no k/v matmuls there.\n- **Sliding window 512** on 35 of 42 layers: their cache never exceeds 512 tokens.\n- **Full layers** use 512-dim heads with p-RoPE (θ 1,000,000, only 25% of dims rotate); sliding use 256-dim heads, RoPE θ 10,000.\n- Unlike Gemma 3n there are **no AltUp / LAuReL tensors**, and every layer has the same 10,240-wide MLP (use_double_wide_mlp = false)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1700,
   "y": 966,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**Sources.** config.json + the safetensors header of google/gemma-4-E4B-it (2,130 tensors, all BF16, one file — no index). Dataflow from transformers modeling_gemma4.py. Context 131,072 positions. Logits softcapped at 30. Attention scale 1 (q and k are RMS-normed; v is RMS-normed without weight)."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpt",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1726,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**Where the parameters are stored (BF16)** — total 8.00B"
  },
  {
   "id": "bp0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1680,
   "width": 1074,
   "height": 44,
   "text": "**FFN ×42**",
   "color": "4"
  },
