  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1630,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "FFN ×42 **3.30B** (41.3%) · attention ×42 **587.2M** (7.3%) · unused K/V of the 18 shared layers **55.1M** (0.7%) · per-layer embed table **2.82B** (35.2%) · embed **671.1M** (8.4%) · PLE gates + projections ×42 **55.2M** (0.7%) · vision encoder **169.3M** (2.1%) · audio encoder **308.8M** (3.9%) · lm head **0** (tied — the embed table) · PLE context projection **27.5M** (0.3%) · norms + layer scalars **0.4M** (<0.1%)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bct",
