   "y": -1430,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "FFN ×42 **3.30B** (71.1%) · attention ×42 **587.2M** (12.6%) · lm head **671.1M** (14.4%) · PLE gates + projections ×42 **55.2M** (1.2%) · unused K/V of the 18 shared layers **0** (dropped on load — K/V come from earlier layers) · per-layer embed table **0** (row lookup, 42×256 numbers) · embed **0** (row lookup) · PLE context projection **27.5M** (0.6%) · vision encoder **0** (runs per image) · audio encoder **0** (runs per audio clip) · norms + layer scalars **0.4M** (<0.1%)"
  }
